  "narrative": "During the night of 17 to 18 October a burning object came through the shop window and a fire started in the sales area, with smoke into the bakehouse. The window and the glass door are destroyed, the refrigerated pastry display is ruined, the sign, paint, false ceiling and lighting are damaged. The oven and proofing cabinet need checking and the bakehouse needs soot decontamination. Raw materials and the day's production are lost. We boarded up and paid a guard. We are closed for 3 weeks and the 4 employees are on short-time work. A neighbouring bakery sells our bread meanwhile and we put up signage.",
